Codegen source fixtures
=======================

Raw .expected files contain unchanged tinygrad
d0c9745274335e44b5dd7c15b8422c2b684a3ed9 output. Adjacent .tolk.expected
files cover the reviewed IEEE differences in DIVERGENCES.md: float grouping,
leading reduction +0, and MAX NaN propagation and second-operand ties.
Dune compares those cases against the explicit local snapshot. Reference
generation excludes local snapshots; no source normalization is used.
